[{"title":"禁林宴会之什","author":"王旦","text":"喜缀真仙宴禁林，玉堂新事好供吟。\n天章刻石兴风雅，宸翰书牌耀古今。\n势逸夺回龙凤迹，调高流入管弦音。\n光凝玉斝琼浆润，冷布花砖药树阴。\n地贵每朝金殿近，景清如到玉壶深。\n得陪嘉会荣观大，虔效赓歌乐圣心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12022,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十洲阁","author":"王旦","text":"山川如幻阁长秋，一岛飞来伴九洲。\n不碍渔樵双桨过，何妨罗绮四时游。\n云疑泰华分张去，永忆蓬瀛散漫浮。\n禁苑未知湖海乐，生绡写取献九州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12023,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠廖融","author":"王正己","text":"湖南虽不就卑官，高卧深云道自安。\n病起坐当秋阁迥，酒醒吟对夜涛寒。\n炉中药熟分僧服，榻上琴闲借我弹。\n幸遇清朝有良鉴，退身争忍似方干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12024,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠蕴上人","author":"王正己","text":"佛法诗名谁更继，未闻随分谒侯王。\n洗盂秋涧日华动，捣药夜堂云气香。\n苔藓乱青封叠石，杉松浓影过空墙。\n若非火岳□□地，那得吾师住久长。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12025,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天开图画亭","author":"王正己","text":"夜来残暑鏖西风，秋声摵摵先井桐。\n纤云四捲天开容，一碧万里磨青铜。\n使君退食新凉逢，厌看凝寝江云浓。\n领客欲送孤飞鸿，城隅高亭湿青红。\n旷望四野开心胸，前瞻江山胜而雄。\n琉璃波光群玉峰，水墨正尔难为工。\n天开地辟今古中，此景自若无初终。\n天岂为我施新功，我心得之眼相从。\n收入几席无遗踪，锦囊得助防诗穷。\n向来神秀造化钟，李成郭熙将无同。\n强名图画托天公，抚掌一笑浮金钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12026,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰改元桂林大比与计偕者十有一人九月十六日用故事行宴享之礼作是诗劝为之驾 其二","author":"王正功","text":"桂林山水甲天下，玉碧罗青意可参。\n士气未饶军气振，文场端似战场酣。\n九关虎豹看劲敌，万里鹍鹏伫剧谈。\n老眼摩挲顿增爽，诸君端是斗之南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12027,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰改元桂林大比与计偕者十有一人九月十六日用故事行宴享之礼作是诗劝为之驾 其一","author":"王正功","text":"百嶂千峰古桂州，乡来人物固难俦。\n峨冠共应贤能诏，策足谁非道艺流。\n经济才猷期远器，纵横礼乐对前旒。\n三君八俊俱乡秀，稳步天津最上头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12028,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰二年岁在壬戌正月八日携家还里幕中诸友远来饯别同游乳洞遂为终日之款因成古风一章","author":"王正功","text":"乳穴佳名久欣慕，兹游直与心期副。\n今朝萧散七枝筇，衰迟未觉跻攀苦。\n湘南悬想碧云横，桂岭遥瞻烟霭暮。\n招提钟磬出幽深，村疃牛羊自来去。\n忽闻流水响潺潺，渐睹岩扃隔烟雾。\n山蹊蹑履乱崎嵚，翠壁题名杂新故。\n乍暌朱墨略官箴，稍觉追随剧幽趣。\n绝知官里少夷途，始信闲中无窘步。\n人生如此信可乐，谁向康庄塞归路。\n共醉生前有限杯，浇我胸中今与古。\n早知富贵如浮云，三叹归田不能赋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12029,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题湖山立石","author":"王汉","text":"如碑卓水滨，磊落未名闻。\n藓駮琼姿出，蜗行篆字分。\n器浑犹抱璞，势迥已凌云。\n幸免随金锻，宁忧与玉焚。\n螭形徒岌岌，鸟迹欠云云。\n若使昌黎见，应摛逐鳄文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12030,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金山独秀峰","author":"王汉","text":"千古压嶙峋，标奇世绝伦。\n形从天赋授，名自我推论。\n众岳犹前席，群峰合望尘。\n不知居海郡，知己是何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12031,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘阮洞 其二","author":"王汉之","text":"二女春游阆苑花，醉邀刘阮饭胡麻。\n仙衣忽逐笙箫去，空倚山头恨落霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12032,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘阮洞 其一","author":"王汉之","text":"洞府门閒白日赊，碧潭清影照云霞。\n弄珠人捧江皋佩，刻玉岩开阆苑花。\n风月有情回俗驾，尘埃无处问仙家。\n归来怅望金桥处，露滴桃源一径斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12033,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措","author":"王玉","text":"杨花绕昼暖风多。\n晴云点池波。\n戏数翠萍几靥，零星未碍圆荷。\n软人天气，半如溽暑，半似清和。\n说与香篝缊火，酒痕梅却衣罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12034,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送枢密使楼先生还乡","author":"王用","text":"辅治皇朝已有年，一朝辞老意乾乾。\n满京朱紫咸怀德，设席城门表大贤。\n别酒斟来须罄盏，阳关迭唱促开船。\n于今解职归田里，指日丹书下九天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12035,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平绿轩","author":"王用亨","text":"尘嚣胸次尝苦隘，谁谓一隅天地宽。\n野色供餐来几上，山光极目在林端。\n犁耕宿雨春风暖，舟撼清流夜雨寒。\n却笑贺湖临水寺，闭门不借俗人看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12036,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝林寺","author":"王申","text":"千载宝林寺，清幽每往还。\n两潮岩上井，一塔寺中山。\n门对荒城冷，邻分古县闲。\n道人高处坐，役役笑尘寰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12037,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅","author":"王石室","text":"静参香影句，独向野桥行。\n数点水边白，十分天下清。\n嫩条尤劲直，老树更晶明。\n冰雪穷冬里，春风赖尔生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12038,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游灵岩","author":"王龙学","text":"古寺山坰远，蹻攀一径斜。\n洞深留碧霭，溪急荡晴沙。\n殿接岩松影，堂邻野客家。\n谒僧询世事，无语指灯花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12039,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题翠岩亭","author":"王亘","text":"一壑盘苍玉，峰峦尺五天。\n人间怪泉石，岭外好山川。\n寺近鲸宵吼，林深犊昼眠。\n谪仙三百载，此乐有谁传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12040,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次胡澹庵题挹翠轩韵","author":"王亘","text":"西山排闼来，周遭自环翠。\n俗眼少见之，一览忘世味。\n平生三径心，盍早赋归计。\n纵落尘土居，不与草木敝。\n公馀事幽寻，清风拂衣袂。\n最喜轩中人，所挹多爽气。\n蓬蒿天地宽，万境发诗思。\n白云未能閒，时出过窗几。\n檐雨听夜语，池草生春媚。\n山灵若相知，好风为裂眦。\n馀光虽力挽，回次那得致。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12041,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西楼","author":"王亘","text":"西江横玉虹，西山罗画屏。\n荒城大如斗，此楼何峥嵘。\n炎岭状陇蜀，三州通蓬瀛。\n人烟几村落，数点如晨星。\n谁识海一涯，好峰无数青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12042,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题苏端明书乳泉赋后","author":"王学可","text":"苏公早闻道，文章乃其戏。\n乳泉出重海，作赋聊记异。\n玉池咽中夜，挈瓶非小智。\n气者水之生，此语可深味。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12043,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海寇赵某伏诛","author":"王亦世","text":"凭陵海若玩波神，怙恃乾坤不杀身。\n刀锯未加先自殒，陆梁未有白头人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12044,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"王仲宁","text":"妙曲挠周郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12045,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留京师思归","author":"王仲甫","text":"黄金零落大刀头，玉箸归期划到秋。\n红锦寄鱼风逆浪，碧箫吹凤月当楼。\n伯劳知我经春别，香蜡窥人一夜愁。\n好去渡江千里梦，满天梅雨是苏州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12046,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丑奴儿/采桑子","author":"王仲甫","text":"牡丹不好长春好，有个因依。\n一两枝儿。\n但是风光总属伊。\n当初祗为嫦娥种，月正明时。\n教恁芳菲。\n伴著团圆十二回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12047,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙","author":"王仲甫","text":"忆得延州，旧曾相见，东城近东下住。\n被若著意引归家，放十分、以上抬举。\n小样罗衫，淡红拂过，风流万般做处。\n怕伊蓦地忆人时，梦中来、不要迷路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12048,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓦山溪 其二","author":"王仲甫","text":"挂冠神武，来作烟花主。\n千里好江山，都尽是、君恩赐与。\n风勾月引，催上泛宅时，酒倾玉，脍堆雪，总道神仙侣。\n蓑衣箬笠，更著些儿雨。\n横笛两三声，晚云中、惊鸥来去。\n欲烦妙手，写入散人图，蜗角名，蝇头利，著甚来由顾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12049,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉落魄/一斛珠","author":"王仲甫","text":"醉醒醒醉。\n凭君会取皆滋味。\n浓斟琥珀香浮蚁。\n一入愁肠，便有阳春意。\n须将席幕为天地。\n歌前起舞花前睡。\n从他兀兀陶陶里。\n犹胜醒醒，惹得闲憔悴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12050,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆侄耆登第","author":"王仲修","text":"锡宴便倾光禄酒，赐袍还照上林花。\n衣冠盛事堪书日，六世词科只一家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12051,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其二十三","author":"王仲修","text":"汉殿东风弄晓晴，百花烘日近清明。\n披香博士今华发，教得六宫歌舞成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12052,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十六","author":"王仲修","text":"煌煌玉烛四时平，顺气熏蒸万物成。\n谩说蓬莱宫里橘，宣和殿下荔枝生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12053,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其七十三","author":"王仲修","text":"万类欣欣谢至阴，斡旋造化圣功深。\n须知天地生成意，便是君王爱物心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12054,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其八十七","author":"王仲修","text":"爱读仙经沐道风，碧窗时叩紫阳钟。\n为逢节假无祗应，写了黄庭日未舂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12055,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十七","author":"王仲修","text":"仁渐动植露华滋，朱实累累近玉墀。\n闻道庙堂恩数渥，宰臣新赐荔枝时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12056,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十五","author":"王仲修","text":"日斜未掩苑东门，池面风烟向晚昏。\n谁道荷花娇欲语，夜来露冷却无言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12057,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十三","author":"王仲修","text":"殿角风摇柳带长，御沟流水落花香。\n雨来双燕归应早，先上珠帘十二行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12058,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六","author":"王仲修","text":"雪消鸳瓦东风暖，已觉金虬刻漏长。\n禁里春寒犹未放，日华先拂赭袍光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12059,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十四","author":"王仲修","text":"太液池头水浸云，绿荷摇曳露华新。\n漾舟寻得双莲子，摘向金盘赠圣人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12060,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十一","author":"王仲修","text":"九月飞霜天地清，未央前殿燕簪缨。\n欲知重谷为先务，八彩眉间喜顺成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12061,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十九","author":"王仲修","text":"上如尧舜爱民深，宵旰忧勤冠古今。\n后苑珍禽都放尽，万方人识好生心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12062,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十","author":"王仲修","text":"花药栏干小雨晴，差差燕子拂帘旌。\n今朝下直全无事，写得新翻曲谱成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12063,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十二","author":"王仲修","text":"十三应选入宫来，便舞梁州送御杯。\n交袂当筵小垂手，回头招拍趁虚催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12064,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十一","author":"王仲修","text":"华渚星流生睿主，九天歌管宴钧台。\n愿将圣寿齐南极，碧海蟠桃万度开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12065,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十二","author":"王仲修","text":"三伏金藏暑正隆，火云万里日轮红。\n禁中自有清凉地，不借麻姑避暑宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12066,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十八","author":"王仲修","text":"雪消宫殿苑梅芳，晓漏声迟下建章。\n天气清寒当腊日，沉香甲煎赐诸房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12067,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其六十四","author":"王仲修","text":"道山玉府尽唐馀，因命儒臣校鲁鱼。\n黄帕担床擎入内，麟台先进御前书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12068,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其二十五","author":"王仲修","text":"凤阙巍峨瑞气间，御沟春晚水潺潺。\n吾皇勤政无游幸，天厩门深八骏闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12069,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其二十一","author":"王仲修","text":"欲晓初闻长乐钟，一庭残月海棠红。\n如何借得徐熙手，画作屏风立殿中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12070,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十五","author":"王仲修","text":"景阳钟动趁严妆，奉帚追随过未央。\n月落金门才放钥，御衣初试百花香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12071,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十八","author":"王仲修","text":"八宝盘龙玉色明，未央排仗庆熙成。\n敛时福瑞为天赦，五岳齐呼万岁声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12072,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十三","author":"王仲修","text":"鳞鳞鸳瓦静无烟，六幕云低腊雪天。\n应是风流学胡蝶，过墙飞舞自翩翩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12073,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九","author":"王仲修","text":"殿外轻寒一凭栏，春衫初试觉微宽。\n钗头故插宜男草，图得君王带笑看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12074,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十五","author":"王仲修","text":"国家三岁一郊天，万骑云从锦绣鲜。\n陟降圆坛彻黄道，更虚小次待升烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12075,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十二","author":"王仲修","text":"岳神当面捧南山，馥郁非烟拥圣颜。\n法部笙歌催献寿，閤门先引内朝班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12076,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十九","author":"王仲修","text":"月沉天角晓星明，上直妆成趁五更。\n昨夜宣徽进新曲，仙韶院里未知名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12077,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十八","author":"王仲修","text":"银河初转水横流，星史人催报晓筹。\n金凤凰门开万钥，玉蟾蜍影挂西楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12078,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其五十六","author":"王仲修","text":"璧月珠星应律灰，两班称庆一阳回。\n九韶声里千秋曲，五色云中万寿杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12079,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十一","author":"王仲修","text":"艾虎钗头映翠翘，菖蒲泛酒舞宫腰。\n不须更铸江心照，皇帝聪明一似尧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12080,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十八","author":"王仲修","text":"春气融和万物佳，殿前仍有四时花。\n宫人却爱山家景，松竹阴中碾建茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12081,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十三","author":"王仲修","text":"暑天何处避炎蒸，驾在萧台第九层。\n黄盖亭亭日将午，宫嫔催赐近臣冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12082,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其二十八","author":"王仲修","text":"微凉殿阁庆云边，正是清和长养天。\n解愠阜财君德厚，熏风长泛舜琴弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12083,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其八十一","author":"王仲修","text":"茧馆轻寒晓漏残，春阴桑柘碧于蓝。\n宵衣愿治先农事，故敕宫娥学养蚕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12084,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十","author":"王仲修","text":"金盘碧粽裹雕菰，九节菖蒲渍玉壶。\n拓地直临西海岸，朱书无用辟兵符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12085,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"王仲修","text":"四海梯航贺岁元，千官环佩拜中天。\n愿从今日称觞后，舜殿垂衣一万年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12086,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十四","author":"王仲修","text":"银河清浅夜纵横，鱼钥传呼锁禁城。\n试上红楼三十级，凭栏好看月初生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12087,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其八十八","author":"王仲修","text":"蒙金衫子郁金黄，爱拍伊州入侧商。\n人道飞琼元自瘦，娉婷偏称窄衣裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12088,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其九十七","author":"王仲修","text":"下直归来日未晡，凤盘锦幄卷流苏。\n纱栊粉壁无尘到，挂起长康列女图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12089,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十一","author":"王仲修","text":"云娇烟懒雨初晴，环碧风轻细浪生。\n尽日黄鹂不飞去，万年枝上听箫声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12090,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十六","author":"王仲修","text":"红乾绿淡有馀香，芳草芊绵苑路长。\n鶗鴂一声寒食雨，游蜂应为百花忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12091,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十四","author":"王仲修","text":"玉阑万朵牡丹开，先摘姚黄献御杯。\n翠幕重重围绕定，料应蜂蝶不曾来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":12092,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]